  {
   "id": "appendix-quick-reference-md-11",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "Structs are sealed (no undeclared fields), references by default\n(`@kind(semantics: value(copy))` for values), and `==` compares fields. See\n[Structs, Methods and Kinds](https://docs.crushlang.org/crush/structs.html).\n\n### Capabilities ([Capabilities](https://docs.crushlang.org/crush/capabilities.html))\n\nCapability calls are dotted and have **no `@`**. They exist only if you enabled\nthem:\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
   "meta": {},
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
