  {
   "id": "appendix-quick-reference-md-14",
   "kind": {
    "type": "markdown"
   },
   "source": "### Polyglot blocks ([Polyglot](https://docs.crushlang.org/crush/polyglot.html))\n\n`@python -> out { }`, `@javascript -> out { }` and `@bash { }` run as host\nsubprocesses, only with `--polyglot`, and with the host's full authority (no sandbox\nby default). Names a block reads are passed in; the names after `->` come back.\nWithout the flag the program is refused:\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "done"
   },
   "meta": {},
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "id": "appendix-quick-reference-8",
   "kind": {
    "type": "crush"
   },
   "source": "fn main() {\n    @python {\n        print(\"hello from python\")\n    }\n}\n",
   "state": {
    "status": "pending"
   },
   "meta": {
